          %p
            This is a general statement about modules with respect to
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Day+convolution"} Day convolution
            monoidal structures, see
            %a{:href => "Day+convolution#ModulesInDayConvolutionAreFunctorsOnFreeModulesOp"} this proposition
            (
            %a{:href => "#MMSS00"}> MMSS 00, theorem 2.2
            ).
          #SequentialSpectraAsFunctorsOnFreeSSequModules.num_example
            %h6#example Example
            %p
              For the sequential case
              = succeed "," do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi dia
                      %mo =
                      %mi Seq
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} dia = Seq
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
