                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbb{S}_{Seq}
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/action"} action
              on these is, expressed as
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/modules+over+monoidal+functors"} modules over monoidal functors
              (via
              %a{:href => "Day+convolution#DayMonoidsAreLaxMonoidalFunctorsOnTheSite"} this fact
              about modules with respect to
              = succeed ")" do
