            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+groups"} homotopy groups
            but the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/stable+homotopy+groups"} stable homotopy groups
            that are to be invariants of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/stable+homotopy+types"} stable homotopy types
            (this is def.
            %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#StableEquivalencesForDiagramSpectra"}
            below with an extra subtlety in the case of symmetric spectra, see prop.
            %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#RelationBetweenStableEquivalencesAndStableWeakHomotopyEquivalencesForDiagramSpectra"}
            below). Incorporating the latter is accomplished by a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bousfield+localization+of+model+categories"} left Bousfield localizatiob
            of the strict model structures to the genuine stable model structures
            = succeed "." do
