              is a stable weak homotopy equivalence precisely if any of its
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/reduced+suspension"} suspensions
              is. Hence consider instead
              = succeed "," do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
