              is the smash product of a projection map of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/coset+spaces"} coset spaces
              with the identity on the sphere:
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
