              has the same form as in the orthogonal case above, except that all occurences of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/orthogonal+groups"} orthogonal groups
              are replaced by just their sub-
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/symmetric+groups"}> symmetric groups
              \.
            %p Accordingly, the analysis then proceeds entirely analogously, with the key difference that the projection
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi Σ
