            %p
              are compatible with their
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/monoidal+category"} monoidal category
              structure given by the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/symmetric+monoidal+smash+product+of+spectra"} symmetric monoidal smash product of spectra
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
